<title>USA: TABLE - Riverwood International sells 144a notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Riverwood International sells 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Riverwood International Corp was priced Wednesday via lead manager Chase Securities Inc, according to a market source.</p>
<p>Riverwood International, based in Atlanta, Georgia, manufacturers food and consumer goods packaging.</p>
<p>BORROWER RIVERWOOD INTERNATIONAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 10.625 PCT MATURITY 8/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD  10.625 PCT PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS			   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: Three-year equity call for 35 percent of the issue at 110.625.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
